<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan cautions on disposal of division.</title>
<headline>Cullinan cautions on disposal of division.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Further to a cautionary last month, Cullinan Holdings Ltd said on Friday negotiations were in progress regarding the disposal of its electrical division.</p>
<p>The company was also proceeding with recapitalisation arrangements, details of which would be announced shortly, it said.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution when dealing in the company's shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
